  "description": "Typed OData client core for Dynamics 365 Finance and Operations: entity-set aware CRUD on any generated DataServiceContext, Entra ID authentication with a client secret or a managed identity, API Management subscription header, cross-company queries, a request pipeline that trims POST and PATCH bodies to the fields D365FO accepts (writable, create-only, server-assigned keys), retry on transient failures, and a base class for generated per-entity services. The generated proxies for a specific tenant live in a separate package.",
